Package: com.adarsh.atelier
Name: Atelier
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: A workbench of live apps. One big app and up to four mini tiles of other apps on one screen: tap a mini and it changes places with the big one. Three layouts (minis at the side, minis on top, or two apps side by side), saved sets of two to five apps that open together, and minis that freeze to stills when you stop touching the bench so they cost no battery. Opens with a swipe from the screen edge near the bottom corner or from an app icon's menu. Lives in SpringBoard: no helper app.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, preferenceloader
